<title>RUSSIA: Russian M2 money supply rises sharply in December.</title>
<headline>Russian M2 money supply rises sharply in December.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian M2 money supply rose to 295.2 trillion roubles at the beginning of January from 282.3 trillion a month earlier, Central Bank First Deputy Chairman Sergei Aleksashenko said on Monday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN MONEY SUPPLY	   JAN 97     DEC 96     JAN 96</p>
<p>    M2 volume			   295.2	282.3	220.8</p>
<p>    cash in circulation (MO)	103.8	 95.8	 80.8</p>
<p>NOTES - Volumes in trillion roubles. Monthly figures expressed as totals on first day of month.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
